abstract: >-
  The SWAT+ hydrological model translated from Fortran into Rust (SWAT+ commit 6f51536), with
  output tables identical bit for bit to SWAT+'s on four scenarios and 33 variants; native and
  WebAssembly, text or Parquet output, no dependencies. Written with Claude (Anthropic) under the
  author's direction; every change validated against SWAT+ Fortran in continuous integration.
